WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:13.110
<b>A Playthrough of a Certain DUDE's
VRMMO LIFE</b>

01:30.610 --> 01:34.900
Episode 7: Earth Challenges a Boss

01:43.540 --> 01:45.150
<i>Stun?!</i>

01:45.150 --> 01:45.910
<i>Damn it!</i>

01:45.910 --> 01:48.260
<i>I can't move! This isn't good...</i>

02:00.320 --> 02:05.070
<i>As for how I found myself 
in this situation...</i>

02:05.520 --> 02:08.440
<b>Several Days Prior</b>

02:09.490 --> 02:11.860
<i>After making myself a set of tools,</i>

02:11.860 --> 02:15.280
<i>I spent my days going into the dungeon solo.</i>

02:15.280 --> 02:20.530
<i>My goal, of course, was to improve my 
lockpicking and trap disarming skills.</i>

02:28.840 --> 02:32.020
<i>Well, at first I messed up all the time,</i>

02:32.020 --> 02:34.390
<i>and sometimes even got myself 
killed in the process.</i>

02:38.480 --> 02:43.840
<i>But after a lot of practice, 
my thief skill finally reached level 50!</i>

02:43.850 --> 02:49.270
<b>Your Thief Skill has reached Lv50.
You have unlocked the ability
to specialize into either Superior Thief
or Benevolent Thief. Which will you choose?

Superior Thief / Benevolent Thief</b>

02:44.300 --> 02:47.220
<i>Now I can evolve it into 
a higher ranked skill.</i>

02:47.880 --> 02:49.260
Hm...

02:49.630 --> 02:54.650
Superior Thief is a more powerful version 
of thief that does mostly the same things.

02:54.650 --> 02:56.270
And Benevolent Thief can...

02:57.170 --> 03:00.230
steal from monsters...

03:02.370 --> 03:04.840
or get a bonus while sneak attacking,

03:04.840 --> 03:07.120
which are things a normal thief can't do.

03:07.390 --> 03:11.580
It will require more EXP to evolve, however.

03:13.900 --> 03:15.810
Benevolent Thief, definitely.

03:15.810 --> 03:17.800
That sounds a lot more fun.

03:21.100 --> 03:22.270
Red?

03:22.260 --> 03:27.270
<b>Gang of Six Rangers
One More Rangers</b>

03:27.440 --> 03:29.190
At last, the time has come.

03:29.190 --> 03:32.330
Yah-wah-who-wha-wuh!

03:32.330 --> 03:34.260
Black is here!

03:32.940 --> 03:34.690
<b>Black</b>

03:34.680 --> 03:39.390
So, yeah, nice to meet you, Earth.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.970
Now, let us begin.

03:41.970 --> 03:43.080
Sure thing.

03:43.630 --> 03:48.240
Oh, my! A new type of trap!

03:48.240 --> 03:51.250
Wow, fascinating!

03:51.250 --> 03:54.510
Look how clever this is! Wonderful!

03:54.510 --> 03:56.520
Indeed!

03:56.520 --> 04:00.120
Look what happens if you try 
to pick it the normal way!

03:56.580 --> 04:01.830
Hey, why are those two getting so 
excited over disarming a trap?

04:00.120 --> 04:05.430
Brilliant, Earth! You noticed the trick!

04:01.830 --> 04:04.560
I introduced them because 
I thought they'd get along,

04:04.560 --> 04:06.590
but I didn't expect them 
to get along so well.

04:05.580 --> 04:07.400
Okay, now here...

04:07.810 --> 04:09.020
Think we can do it?

04:09.020 --> 04:11.210
Indeed we can!

04:19.500 --> 04:24.330
<i>And at the same time, I kept 
going into the dungeon myself.</i>

04:25.120 --> 04:27.150
<i>And as I disarmed more and more traps,</i>

04:27.470 --> 04:31.080
<i>my success rate began to increase...</i>

04:32.980 --> 04:37.440
<i>And my Benevolent Thief 
skill was increasing, too.</i>

04:37.440 --> 04:40.340
<i>There was something else 
I noticed while I was down there.</i>

04:40.810 --> 04:43.760
<i>How the monsters in the dungeon worked.</i>

04:44.140 --> 04:48.560
<i>They seemed to be attracted to light.</i>

04:48.560 --> 04:49.790
<i>And so...</i>

04:50.470 --> 04:53.640
<i>I was able to use my Long-Distance Vision skill,
 which lets me see in the dark,</i>

04:53.920 --> 04:57.360
<i>to drastically reduce the number 
of battles I had to fight.</i>

04:58.760 --> 05:03.400
<i>Once I realized that, I was able 
to avoid unnecessary fights,</i>

05:03.400 --> 05:06.390
<i>and go deeper into the dungeon.</i>

05:07.390 --> 05:16.390
<i>And today, I reached the staircase 
to the next-to-last level on my own.</i>

05:19.540 --> 05:22.260
Now then, how much time do I have left?

05:22.670 --> 05:26.090
<b>Time Remaining</b>

05:23.460 --> 05:25.540
Just over five minutes...

05:27.450 --> 05:31.210
That's not a lot. 
There are liches on the 9th floor.

05:31.600 --> 05:34.260
I have to take my time.

05:34.600 --> 05:37.440
Well, I'll just have to 
see how far I can get.

06:03.940 --> 06:05.050
That was close.

06:05.570 --> 06:07.570
Watch out for liches!

06:07.570 --> 06:11.450
Not only do they use status attacks, 
they'll also summon nearby monsters,

06:11.450 --> 06:13.120
which means big trouble!

06:14.610 --> 06:17.490
That makes them really 
tough for solo players!

06:17.920 --> 06:20.710
<i>If I end up fighting that 
thing, I'm done for.</i>

06:20.710 --> 06:23.390
<i>Gotta be careful!</i>

06:24.860 --> 06:27.740
<b>Time Remaining</b>

06:33.940 --> 06:35.410
What is this?

06:38.340 --> 06:41.250
The staircase is right there!

06:41.570 --> 06:44.790
<i>I don't have time to disarm 
all these traps...</i>

06:45.520 --> 06:47.170
<i>I guess I'll just have to go for it!</i>

06:53.770 --> 06:55.510
Ad Caelum!

06:56.920 --> 06:57.960
Fly!

07:04.070 --> 07:05.810
Just a little more!

07:07.230 --> 07:08.710
<i>Is this the end?</i>

07:09.340 --> 07:11.680
No, I'll go as far...

07:14.210 --> 07:15.370
as I can!

07:24.700 --> 07:26.840
It didn't kick me out of the dungeon?

07:30.760 --> 07:32.940
The timer stopped?

07:35.950 --> 07:37.770
<i>What's going on here?</i>

07:37.770 --> 07:39.720
<i>I'm still on the staircase...</i>

07:40.180 --> 07:43.350
<i>Does this mean I'm regarded as 
having reached the last floor?</i>

07:45.460 --> 07:47.490
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

07:49.150 --> 07:53.480
<i>I've reached a place nobody else has.</i>

08:17.310 --> 08:18.320
Oh?

08:19.000 --> 08:20.220
Who's there?

08:20.680 --> 08:24.530
I didn't expect anyone to 
reach this place alone.

08:26.240 --> 08:29.760
My name is Andre. I am a knight of the Empire.

08:30.500 --> 08:33.770
Well, that was a long, long time ago.

08:34.990 --> 08:36.960
This staircase is long.

08:36.960 --> 08:41.460
Listen to my tale. It will give you something 
to think about on the long way down.

08:43.350 --> 08:47.760
My nation ordered me to 
investigate this place,

08:47.760 --> 08:51.010
the Labyrinth of the Departed, 
and seal it away.

08:51.310 --> 08:54.340
I led a great army inside,

08:54.340 --> 08:58.310
but the monsters and traps slew them all.

08:59.250 --> 09:01.540
In the end, I was the last one left.

09:01.540 --> 09:09.080
I journeyed through the labyrinth 
alone and reached the deepest room.

09:10.500 --> 09:11.740
But...

09:24.620 --> 09:26.910
There was nothing there.

09:31.310 --> 09:33.830
Not even air to breathe.

09:35.890 --> 09:40.270
I died there, and was transformed 
into a skeleton knight

09:40.270 --> 09:44.180
that is forced to protect this dungeon.

09:45.320 --> 09:48.900
You came to seal the labyrinth, 
and they turned you into its guardian?

09:51.070 --> 09:53.520
Is this room still there?

09:53.940 --> 09:56.680
No. I destroyed it.

09:57.230 --> 10:00.780
I am the only one who will 
ever die from such a trap.

10:02.250 --> 10:05.380
<i>Even in death, he still tried 
to be a noble knight...</i>

10:05.900 --> 10:09.650
You'll find me waiting at 
the bottom of the stairs.

10:10.220 --> 10:11.970
And what do you want me to do?

10:13.260 --> 10:14.810
Kill me.

10:17.040 --> 10:20.390
I have endured this long, refusing to let 
my heart become that of a monster, as well.

10:20.390 --> 10:22.510
But I will not be able to 
keep that up much longer.

10:23.160 --> 10:24.590
I am tired.

10:27.110 --> 10:29.520
Please, let me be free...

10:29.520 --> 10:32.320
To be with my men... my comrades.

11:03.760 --> 11:05.860
A-Andre?

11:12.110 --> 11:13.180
At last!

11:13.180 --> 11:15.650
At last, you gave in, Andre!

11:15.650 --> 11:17.560
This sword! This body!

11:17.560 --> 11:19.610
They're all mine!

11:29.210 --> 11:31.200
What the hell was that for?

11:31.590 --> 11:33.260
Stop talking.

11:33.260 --> 11:34.910
You're pissing me off.

11:36.520 --> 11:39.370
How dare you, human?

11:39.370 --> 11:44.050
I'll make you suffer before you die!

11:47.910 --> 11:49.930
<i>He traveled that distance 
in a single instant?</i>

11:55.670 --> 11:58.710
The fight's not over yet.

11:59.640 --> 12:03.070
<i>He's fast. And he hits hard!</i>

12:03.070 --> 12:06.000
Excellent. Just like I hoped!

12:06.210 --> 12:09.410
You want to focus on defending? Very well!

12:11.150 --> 12:14.540
Flames? How dare you?!

12:15.260 --> 12:17.900
You think I'm just defending, huh?

12:17.900 --> 12:19.930
I don't fight with a sword!

12:19.930 --> 12:22.750
I'm not going to fight you head-on!

12:22.750 --> 12:23.770
You aren't, huh?

12:23.770 --> 12:25.030
Then...

12:29.770 --> 12:31.480
<i>Break Arms?</i>

12:36.410 --> 12:38.890
Your bow can't help you now.

12:39.640 --> 12:42.490
This time, you're finished. Right, human?

12:42.490 --> 12:44.330
Give it up.

12:46.170 --> 12:49.550
I told you. It's not over yet.

12:49.890 --> 12:50.900
What?

12:51.190 --> 12:53.120
I've got more tricks in store.

12:53.540 --> 12:56.080
You haven't won yet.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.980
How fun.

13:04.540 --> 13:08.760
<i>But my Secret Another Bow isn't invincible.</i>

13:08.760 --> 13:10.580
<i>It can only fire special arrows,</i>

13:10.580 --> 13:12.340
<i>and I can't use any arts with it.</i>

13:12.340 --> 13:15.720
<i>But it fires fast, and I can aim 
faster than with a big bow.</i>

13:15.720 --> 13:19.030
<i>I'll fight not with power, 
but with quantity!</i>

13:19.510 --> 13:22.990
Stop moving around! You're making me mad!

13:22.990 --> 13:24.610
Shield Charge!

13:25.420 --> 13:26.070
What?

13:26.540 --> 13:28.000
Shield Chaser!

13:35.970 --> 13:37.510
<i>Stun?!</i>

13:37.510 --> 13:38.300
<i>Damn it!</i>

13:38.300 --> 13:40.700
<i>I can't move! This isn't good...</i>

13:51.930 --> 13:55.730
I didn't expect I would 
have to use this art.

13:57.750 --> 14:00.440
But this has gone on long enough.

14:00.440 --> 14:03.870
I'll send you to the god you love so much.

14:04.190 --> 14:06.770
To my god, you say?

14:07.260 --> 14:10.910
Whenever something happens, 
you always pray to your god.

14:10.910 --> 14:14.670
Because you love him so much, right?

14:23.810 --> 14:24.950
Curse you!

14:25.300 --> 14:27.650
There are no gods in this world!

14:29.380 --> 14:32.730
The only thing you'll find in 
this place is the human will,

14:32.730 --> 14:34.900
which struggles to survive,
 no matter how bad things get!

14:36.540 --> 14:40.150
Then show me your will!

14:40.860 --> 14:43.070
All right, I will!

14:43.420 --> 14:45.100
Triangle Shot!

14:47.680 --> 14:50.410
I use a diagonal kick after 
creating an illusion!

14:55.560 --> 14:59.560
Fairies everywhere, hear my voice!

14:59.560 --> 15:01.790
Grant my wish!

15:01.790 --> 15:04.320
My prayers lie with the fairies!

15:06.030 --> 15:08.410
With my great wish!

15:08.780 --> 15:11.690
I make my wish unto the 
great ruler of the fairies.

15:11.690 --> 15:13.010
I make my wish to their ruler.

15:13.330 --> 15:17.600
I offer up a portion of my magic 
to the great ruler of the fairies,

15:13.750 --> 15:14.930
Is that all you've got?

15:14.930 --> 15:16.840
An incantation? He's using magic?

15:17.510 --> 15:20.430
Give up and die already!

15:18.270 --> 15:20.430
that she might empower my soul.

15:20.700 --> 15:24.220
Grant me your great 
protection this one time.

15:24.770 --> 15:27.200
Let that protection, and my magic,

15:27.200 --> 15:32.850
become a strength that brings pain and 
despair unto the enemy before me.

15:33.800 --> 15:36.000
Stop that spell!

15:36.000 --> 15:42.960
May this incantation be my vow, and may 
I be granted the aid of the fairy queen,

15:43.450 --> 15:45.720
that the glory and honor of this 
victory be offered up unto her!

15:45.720 --> 15:48.460
I won't let you finish it!

15:48.460 --> 15:52.110
There will be no miracles!

15:55.470 --> 15:57.380
My name is Earth!

15:57.380 --> 16:02.110
He who was granted this skill 
by the 87th Fairy Queen!

16:05.980 --> 16:11.820
By the contract we swore, may a 
single miracle manifest before me.

16:12.260 --> 16:17.200
My wish becomes a spell, 
a plea unto the Fairy Queen.

16:17.200 --> 16:21.200
Grant my wish!

16:24.980 --> 16:27.910
Annihilate my foe with true power!

16:28.420 --> 16:31.060
Elder Prism Nova!

16:28.420 --> 16:31.340
<b>Elder Prism Nova</b>

16:41.260 --> 16:43.200
<i>I recited the whole incantation,</i>

16:43.200 --> 16:45.690
<i>so it's the most powerful 
Prism Nova I can do...</i>

16:45.690 --> 16:47.610
<i>Please, give me petrification 
or paralysis...</i>

16:47.610 --> 16:51.230
<i>Something that will get me out of this!</i>

16:57.120 --> 16:59.800
You're going to pay for that, human!

17:00.080 --> 17:01.500
<i>No luck, huh?</i>

17:04.480 --> 17:05.840
<i>What's this?</i>

17:07.100 --> 17:08.250
<i>An illusion?</i>

17:09.370 --> 17:10.550
You!

17:10.870 --> 17:13.850
That ring... are you his contract partner?

17:14.680 --> 17:16.090
I see...

17:16.090 --> 17:17.730
It's the effect of the ring!

17:34.570 --> 17:36.520
Thanks, Queen!

17:41.750 --> 17:43.260
Now, to finish this!

17:44.650 --> 17:46.260
Wide Arrow!

17:46.260 --> 17:48.050
Gatling Arrow!

17:48.050 --> 17:49.760
Twin-Fanged Arrow!

17:49.760 --> 17:51.300
Mirror Arrow!

17:51.300 --> 17:53.080
Arrow Twister!

17:54.350 --> 17:56.310
Now explode!

18:09.850 --> 18:12.230
Did I get him?

18:16.740 --> 18:18.130
Splendid.

18:18.130 --> 18:19.410
Victory is yours.

18:19.880 --> 18:22.470
Is that you, Andre?

18:22.470 --> 18:23.620
Yup.

18:24.610 --> 18:29.410
You defeated him before my soul disappeared.

18:29.750 --> 18:33.230
You gave me a little time to thank you.

18:34.850 --> 18:36.020
I see...

18:36.520 --> 18:39.670
So I gave you what you wanted?

18:40.010 --> 18:40.970
Yup.

18:40.970 --> 18:43.930
You've given me even more than I hoped for!

18:44.360 --> 18:49.370
I never thought I'd be able to meet 
my end as a human, not a monster!

18:49.370 --> 18:51.550
You're so easygoing! 
Is that who you really are?

18:51.550 --> 18:52.970
Sorry, sorry.

18:52.970 --> 18:55.520
I was in a state of complete 
despair before we fought.

18:55.520 --> 18:59.360
Honestly, I figured since you were 
playing solo, you didn't have a chance.

18:59.360 --> 19:01.290
Sorry about that.

19:06.880 --> 19:09.290
Anyway, it's time to go.

19:10.350 --> 19:13.780
Thanks, really. For defeating me.

19:14.310 --> 19:17.750
As a reward, you can have my sword.

19:18.170 --> 19:24.100
<b>Knight Sword of an Ancient Knight
Effect: Will break and disappear when used to attack something.</b>

19:18.610 --> 19:23.590
It's a mess, but if you sell it as an antique, 
it should be worth something.

19:24.680 --> 19:26.550
Thanks, Andre.

19:26.940 --> 19:28.780
I'll accept it.

19:29.310 --> 19:32.900
You said that there is no god here.

19:33.510 --> 19:35.100
But I think there is.

19:36.880 --> 19:40.340
I was able to meet my end not 
as a monster, but as a human,

19:40.340 --> 19:43.470
and my companions even came to get me.

19:43.900 --> 19:48.450
Only God could bring me such luck.

19:50.430 --> 19:55.160
I pray that God blesses the 
path you walk, as well.

20:00.850 --> 20:02.660
Thanks, Andre.

20:03.030 --> 20:05.650
Watch over me while you drink 
a nice glass or something.

20:06.130 --> 20:09.820
If God is real, I'm sure he'll hook you up.

20:15.370 --> 20:18.840
<i>We have an urgent announcement!</i>

20:19.440 --> 20:21.360
<b>Urgent Announcement</b>

20:21.360 --> 20:27.280
<i>One of the secret bosses of "A Challenge 
from the Departed" has been defeated.</i>

20:27.600 --> 20:32.560
<i>Its defeat has unlocked a new type 
of weapon, the Knight's Sword.</i>

20:33.520 --> 20:36.280
<i>A Knight's Sword is a superior 
version of a one-handed sword,</i>

20:36.280 --> 20:39.190
<i>with a long reach and a powerful attack.</i>

20:40.500 --> 20:45.710
<i>See the upcoming announcement on our 
official home page for more details!</i>

20:46.610 --> 20:52.280
<i>So beating the dungeon 
unlocked a new weapon, huh?</i>

20:52.740 --> 20:55.810
<i>She said "one of the secret bosses,"</i>

20:55.810 --> 20:58.740
<i>which means there are probably 
more weapon unlocks to be found.</i>

21:03.720 --> 21:05.150
No luck, huh?

21:05.690 --> 21:08.150
I can't repair either of them...

21:08.690 --> 21:10.570
I guess I should've known.

21:14.390 --> 21:17.300
Sorry. Thanks for everything 
you've done for me.

21:22.810 --> 21:27.230
I turned my broken weapons 
into a new shield, but...

21:30.760 --> 21:35.590
My bow and leather equipment are 
both a mess and need repairing.

21:36.170 --> 21:38.790
This is gonna hurt my wallet.

21:38.790 --> 21:40.160
But, well...

21:44.950 --> 21:50.580
<i>And so, my time spent fighting 
alone came to an end, for now.</i>

21:59.450 --> 22:02.310
It's finally my turn, huh?

22:02.310 --> 22:06.950
I can't wait to see how they taste.

22:07.470 --> 22:09.930
<b>To Be Continued</b>
